    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9666" root="حى: or حى and حيو" body-key="H">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحيّا مِنْهُ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>He shrank from it:</i> taken from
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَيَآءُ</span> [or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَيَاةُ</span>]; because it is of the nature of
the living to shrink: or it is originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَوَّى</span>;
the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span> being changed into <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ى</span>; or [in other words]
from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَىُّ</span> “ the act of collecting, ” [inf. n. of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوَاهُ</span>,] like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَيَّزَ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَوْزُ</span>. (TA.) [See
also 10.]

